# Gemini.TODO - Anime-Dimension Production Readiness & Anime-Planet Parity

Goal: Make Anime-Dimension production ready and usable, mimicking Anime-Planet's UX for discovering and tracking animations.
Rules:
- Database submodule is AS-IS (no modifications to database submodule; update frontend and backend API as needed).
- Always use Deno for executing commands via `deno task yaml-run <script>`. Never run npm/npx directly.
- Ignore manga; focus strictly on anime/animations.

Review URL: http://127.0.0.1:8088/index.html

---

