### 3. User Anime List Backend & API
- [x] Add `UserAnimeList` table / schema in `UsersDbContext` in `Anime-Dimension-api`
  - Fields: `UserId`, `AnimeSlug` / `AnimeId`, `Title`, `Type`, `Year`, `TotalEpisodes`, `EpisodesWatched`, `Status` (1=Watched, 2=Watching, 3=Dropped, 4=WantToWatch, 5=Stalled, 6=WontWatch), `Rating` (0.5 - 5.0), `TimesWatched`, `UpdatedAt`
- [x] Implement API endpoints:
  - `GET /api/users/{username}/animelist`: fetch user's anime list with optional filters (`status`, `sort`, `letter`, `search`)
  - `GET /api/users/me/animelist/{slug}`: get user's tracking state for a specific anime
  - `POST /api/users/me/animelist`: add or update an anime in user's list (status, eps watched, rating, rewatch)
  - `DELETE /api/users/me/animelist/{slug}`: remove anime from user's list
- [x] Automatically synchronize watch stats (`MinutesWatched`, `Watched`, `Watching`, `Want`, `Stalled`, `Dropped`, `Wont`) and ratings histogram when list entries change

